right before he hosted "SNL.

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:56.449
And he was talking about,
before "Stranger Things,"

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:58.718
like, that was the sort of thing
he was in all the time.

00:01:58.718 --> 00:02:02.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
He sort of played --
He kind of played scuzzier guy

00:02:02.222 --> 00:02:03.623 align:start size:94% position:6%
who were getting in troubl
on "SVU."

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:04.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And that's why
I didn't recognize him.

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:07.127 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-But he made me happy on "SNL.

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:09.529 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I think
that's a good reminder

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:11.598 align:start size:94% position:6%
