is that you can, at some point

00:02:11.598 --> 00:02:13.766 align:start size:94% position:6%
turn it around and host "SNL."
-Start over.

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:14.434 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:18.238 size:81% position:41%
-You -- I want to ask
about your early work,

00:02:18.238 --> 00:02:21.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause we found, you started
wanting to be a comedian.

00:02:21.207 --> 00:02:23.576
-Sort of.
-Yeah, but that appealed to you.

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:25.979 size:84% position:42%
-I thought that's where
we were going with it.

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:26.880 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Gotcha.
-I thought that's what --

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:29.215 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, I did some stuff
a lot of sitcoms.

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:31.217 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I thought,
"This is gonna be great."

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:32.418 line:92%
Did a bunch, four in a row

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:37.724 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I didn't always have
such a great working record.

00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:40.093 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, you did -- We found
a film that you were in

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:42.562 align:start size:94% position:6%
