Is that right?

00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:44.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's the one.
-Yeah.

00:02:44.364 --> 00:02:46.432 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it was --
-It's just funny

00:02:46.432 --> 00:02:48.835 align:start size:94% position:6%
