longest-running character,

00:02:48.835 --> 00:02:50.503 line:92%
the longest-running TV show,

00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:51.905 align:start size:94% position:6%
but it didn't
start out like that.

00:02:51.905 --> 00:02:53.540 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, this was
a very short-run character

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:54.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, super short.
A little too short for me.

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:58.711
-It was a "Power Rangers" movie.
-I was going to be the Queen

00:02:58.711 --> 00:03:00.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You were the Queen
in a "Power Rangers" movie

00:03:00.947 --> 00:03:02.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That was me.
-Look at that!

00:03:02.448 --> 00:03:04.517 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:07.120 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughs ]

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.221 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Look at -- Look at that.

00:03:08.221 --> 00:03:10.290 align:start size:94% position:6%
What was your --
Do you remember the Queen's --

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:13.626 align:start size:94% position:6%
