to play this Queen.

00:03:18.398 --> 00:03:19.232 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I get there,

00:03:19.232 --> 00:03:23.369
hair, makeup, prosthetic pieces,
walking around like that,

00:03:23.369 --> 00:03:25.138 align:start size:94% position:6%
feeling pretty good.
-Yeah.

00:03:25.138 --> 00:03:26.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And it was shooting
in Australia.

00:03:26.906 --> 00:03:32.345 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I was there
for November...

00:03:32.345 --> 00:03:33.513 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-And then December.

00:03:33.513 --> 00:03:35.615 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then we were getting
close to Christmas.

00:03:35.615 --> 00:03:36.883 line:92%
And they had me on hold a lot.

00:03:36.883 --> 00:03:39.052 align:start size:94% position:6%
And finally,
around December 21st,

00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:40.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
