-Yeah.

00:03:43.523 --> 00:03:44.958 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"I think that's only fair."
-Yeah, yeah.

00:03:44.958 --> 00:03:46.459 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So I go home.
I fly home in December.

00:03:46.459 --> 00:03:49.329 align:start size:94% position:6%
