"Sweetie, you're good.

00:03:51.664 --> 00:03:52.966 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don't worry about it."
-Really?

00:03:52.966 --> 00:03:54.834 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, and they fired me.
-Wow!

00:03:54.834 --> 00:03:56.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yep.
-'Cause you left the movie

00:03:56.603 --> 00:03:58.438 size:78% position:39%
