00:04:13.553 --> 00:04:14.687 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They did.
-Wow.

00:04:14.687 --> 00:04:15.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, they did.
-So, this is like --

00:04:15.955 --> 00:04:18.024 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, this very hard to find
what we found.

00:04:18.024 --> 00:04:19.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, this, like,
barely exists anywhere.

00:04:19.926 --> 00:04:21.327 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Nobody knows this.
-Yeah.

00:04:21.327 --> 00:04:22.895 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Just us.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.895 --> 00:04:24.330 align:start size:94% position:6%
-One thing we also
figured out is --

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.766 align:start size:94% position:6%
