by the way, of that.

00:04:26.766 --> 00:04:27.567 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Is that bad?

00:04:27.567 --> 00:04:29.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, no. You should.
This is a good one, too.

00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:30.536 align:start size:94% position:6%
There was one more
I didn't show.

00:04:30.536 --> 00:04:32.739
This is you in all your
splendor, Queen Dulcinea.

00:04:32.739 --> 00:04:35.308 align:start size:94% position:6%
Look at that.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:35.308 --> 00:04:38.111
-You know, it's very --
It's very Wonder Woman-y.

00:04:38.111 --> 00:04:40.313 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, absolutely.
-These are the early beginning

00:04:40.313 --> 00:04:43.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
